---
layout: base.njk
title: "All Battlefield Tours | Heroes and Heritage Tours"
description: "Every Western Front and Normandy tour we run: Vimy to Victory, In Flanders Fields, The Bloody Somme, Juno Beach, Dieppe, and our multi-day Canadian and Normandy journeys."
activeNav: tours
permalink: "/tours.html"
---
{% from "partials/macros.njk" import tourCard %}

<header class="hero hero--compact">
  <div class="hero-media">
    <img src="/photos/somme/somme-cover.jpg" alt="The Beaumont-Hamel Newfoundland Memorial caribou statue" width="1800" height="1200">
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">Western Front tours</span>
      <h1>Many ways to walk in their footsteps.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Every day tour departs from Arras and can be booked alone, or combined into a multi-day journey across the full Canadian story on the Western Front. All tours run in small groups of 8 guests or fewer, led personally by our guide.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Day tours</span>
      <h2>Choose a single day, or combine all three.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="tours-grid" data-reveal>
      {% for tour in tours %}{% if not tour.combo and not tour.normandyRegion %}{{ tourCard(tour) }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Multi-day tours</span>
      <h2>The complete Canadian story.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Our two most popular day tours, or all three, combined into one seamless journey, with accommodation recommendations in the old town of Arras.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tours-grid" data-reveal>
      {% for tour in tours %}{% if tour.combo and not tour.normandyRegion %}{{ tourCard(tour) }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="info-panel" style="position: static; margin-top: var(--space-5); max-width: 760px;" data-reveal>
      <h3>Every tour includes</h3>
      <ul class="info-panel-list">
        <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M3 10.5l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>An expert, English-speaking Western Front guide</li>
        <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M3 10.5l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>A comfortable, air-conditioned 8/9 seat mini bus</li>
        <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M3 10.5l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Pick-up and drop-off at Arras Train Station or your Arras accommodation</li>
        <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M3 10.5l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>All entry fees</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="body-text" style="font-size: 14px;">Prices are quoted in CAD. Itineraries may be varied by consensus of the guests travelling on the day. Customised and private tours are available on request; <a href="/contact.html" style="color: var(--red); font-weight: 600;">get in touch</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="normandy">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Normandy</span>
      <h2>Juno Beach, Dieppe, and the D-Day landing beaches.</h2>
      <p class="lede">From single-day tours of Juno Beach and Dieppe to multi-day journeys across the full American, British and Canadian D-Day story.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tours-grid" data-reveal>
      {% for tour in tours %}{% if tour.normandyRegion %}{{ tourCard(tour) }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: var(--space-5);">
      <a href="/normandy.html" class="btn btn-primary">See All Normandy Tours</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Looking for something else?</span>
      <h2>After a commemorative departure?</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="tours-grid" data-reveal>
      <article class="tour-card">
        <a href="/special-tours.html" class="tour-card-media">
          <img src="/photos/vimy/vimy-cover.jpg" alt="The Canadian National Vimy Memorial against a blue sky" width="800" height="600">
          <span class="tour-card-badge tour-card-badge--combo">Coming Soon</span>
        </a>
        <div class="tour-card-body">
          <h3><a href="/special-tours.html">Special Tours</a></h3>
          <p class="tour-card-desc">Commemorative departures, including Vimy 110 and the 49th Battalion Pilgrimage, planned for 2027.</p>
          <div class="tour-card-footer">
            <a href="/special-tours.html" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Learn more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band" data-reveal>
      <h2>Looking for a more personal journey?</h2>
      <p class="lede">Send us your relative's name and service details, and we'll research their story and build it into your tour.</p>
      <a href="/family-research.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Trace Your Family's Footsteps</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
